      "message": "[scalar-crypto] Importing up-to-date SAIL code for Zkn's aes64ks1i instruction\n\nThe current version of the pseudo SAIL code in the spec did not match the version implemented in sail-riscv.\nA difference in the code could lead to confusion for round number 0xA (10).",
